  "description": "Command-line OCR powered by EasyOcrSharp — EasyOCR's neural models on ONNX Runtime, no Python required. Scans images, PDFs, globs and folders to text, JSON, hOCR, ALTO or TSV, writes searchable PDFs, and pre-pulls models for air-gapped deployment.",
