  "published": "2026-08-27T04:17:27.66Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0: Tracks EasyOcrSharp 3.0.0. The imaging stack moves to EasyImageSharp and the PP-StructureV3 document-structure engine is now built into EasyOcrSharp rather than coming from the third-party PaddleOcrNet package, so no split-licensed dependency remains anywhere in the graph. Models are served from the EasyOcrSharp model repository and cached in one directory shared with the library (%LOCALAPPDATA%/EasyOcrSharp/models), so structure models re-download once after upgrading. No command, flag, output format or exit code changed.",
